{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"slug":[{"Plain":"单值"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"单值"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<blockquote>\n<p>… So suppose that while they were together, Rick and Ilsa went on a trip around the world. As they were traveling, their relationship was evolving, so when they came back to the same point in space – their hometown – their love for each other may have changed.</p>\n<p>Edward Frenkel, "},{"Local":{"url":"FrenkelLoveMath","text":"Love and Math"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}]}}